# Motion vectors of objects (graphics plan 1b, reports/render-features/2026-11-10-motion-vectors/step-1b.md): clips
# for the user's eye, «без векторов | с векторами». The same scenario three times, 1920x1080 on Ryzen:
#   OPENGOTHIC_MOTION_VECTORS=0 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN \
#     scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/motion-vectors-clips.bench <absolute out>
#   the same with OPENGOTHIC_MOTION_VECTORS=1, and with OPENGOTHIC_TAA=0 for the trail measure (the frame without
#   any history). A bench step is 1/30 s, so the frames of the three runs show the same moments.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
# a. The hero walks across a still camera: dark clothes over the cobbles and the gate's stone
walkmode walk
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 600 170 0
wait 8000
cam hold
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 300
rec mv-a-walk
wait 6000
stop
# b. The hero runs, the camera follows him
cam cut
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode run
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
wait 5000
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 300
rec mv-b-run
wait 5000
stop
walkmode walk
# c. A fight close to the camera: two bandits swing at the hero, who stands
cam cut
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
clear 3000
watch player
immortal player on
still player on
arc BDT_1002_BANDIT_L 2 220 45
fight all player
cam look 110
cam world 260 150 0
wait 6000
cam hold
rec mv-c-fight
wait 6000
stop
# d. The town banner in a gust (physics cloth), then a tree in the wind by the road to the farms; the camera stands
cam cut
cloth setup NW_CITY_FLAG_01:1 mv-d-banner
cloth on
cloth wind gust
wait 10000
rec mv-d-banner
wait 6000
stop
cam cut
goto NW_FARM1_PATH_CITY_13
watch player
cam look 300
cam world 600 200 180
wait 10000
cam hold
rec mv-d-tree
wait 6000
stop
# e. The market with passers-by: the camera stands and slowly turns after the hero walking off
cam cut
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 350
cam world 700 280 270
wait 10000
cam fixed
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_SHOP01_FRONT_03
wait 500
rec mv-e-market
wait 7000
stop
